WEBVTT

00:07:55.930 --> 00:08:01.230
and be sensitive to others
who may have different feelings,

00:08:01.263 --> 00:08:02.663
different ideas.

00:08:02.697 --> 00:08:05.763
Explain to the other person,
"You know, you expect me to do X,

00:08:05.797 --> 00:08:08.897
I understand that
you'd like me to do that,

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.997
but I'm doing Y, and this is why.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.497
It's really important to me."

00:08:14.097 --> 00:08:17.063
[How to Deal with Difficult Feelings]